<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan inflation slows to 0.7 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan inflation slows to 0.7 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's monthly inflation rate slowed to 0.7 percent in August from 1.8 percent in July, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH CONSUMER PRICE INFLATION  AUG 96    JUL 96    AUG 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	   +0.7	+1.8	+2.1</p>
<p>The year-on-year percentage change was not available.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
